------------------ Winning and Losing Conditions -------------------
1 Total reputation
2 Balance total
3 Percentage people your hospital has handled
4 Percentage people have been cured
5 Percentage people have been killed
6 Hospital value

#win_criteria[0].Criteria.MaxMin.Value.Group.Bound 1 1 800 1 525
#win_criteria[1].Criteria.MaxMin.Value.Group.Bound 3 1 75 1 0
#win_criteria[2].Criteria.MaxMin.Value.Group.Bound 4 1 1250 1 0

